  "CALL_LINES": [
    "The ten-year is trading at 4.96 percent this morning, about 46 basis points above our 4.50 percent underwriting base, its highest level since October 2023.",
    "Oil has jumped almost 4 percent to just under 104 dollars a barrel on Middle East supply fears, and every basis point that keeps in the ten-year raises our cost of capital into Wednesday's FOMC decision.",
